{
    "title": "Party Charades: Guessing Game",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf89Welcome to <b>Party Charades: Guessing Game!</b> Heads-up the phone and play the game \ufe0f\ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\nGet ready for a blast of laughter and excitement with family games - Party Charades: Guessing Game. Classic party charades game is designed for all ages, ensuring a riotous time at family gatherings, parties, or any social event\r\n\r\n\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>How to play classic party, group games party charades</b>\r\n- Heads-up, divide the group into two teams.\r\n- The player selects a deck including words and phrases, heads up the phone on the forehead.\r\n- Teammates will act, dance, sing, or sketch to describe the words and phrases. Let's guess the word.\r\n- If the answer is correct, tilt your phone down and guess the next word. If wrong or can't guess, tilt the phone up to switch the next words or phrases.\r\n- Time Limited: Challenge your wit and quick thinking as you race against the clock to guess the word on the screen. \r\n\r\n\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>Features of party charades:</b>\r\n- Guess the word, take the challenge: Helps you exercise your brain, think and come up with accurate solutions. Increased creativity and challenge makes players excited.\r\n- Connect, communicate, celebrate: There is nothing better than being able to connect with family, friends, and relatives through a game. Enjoy your wonderful vacation with your wonderful people.\r\n- Unlimited topics: You can freely choose the topics you like, we have enough topics for every holiday, event, party. Topics will be updated regularly.\r\n- Simple graphics and sound, easy to use.\r\n\r\n\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>Party Charades: Guessing Game</b> is more than just a game - it's an experience that brings people together, sparks laughter, and creates lasting memories. With its innovative combination of party charades, and party dynamics, this family and group games is a must-have for anyone who loves a good time. Get ready to elevate your gatherings and let the charades party begin!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf89Welcome to <b>Party Charades: Guessing Game!</b> Heads-up the phone and play the game \ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<br><br>Get ready for a blast of laughter and excitement with family games - Party Charades: Guessing Game. Classic party charades game is designed for all ages, ensuring a riotous time at family gatherings, parties, or any social event<br><br>\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>How to play classic party, group games party charades</b><br>- Heads-up, divide the group into two teams.<br>- The player selects a deck including words and phrases, heads up the phone on the forehead.<br>- Teammates will act, dance, sing, or sketch to describe the words and phrases. Let&#39;s guess the word.<br>- If the answer is correct, tilt your phone down and guess the next word. If wrong or can&#39;t guess, tilt the phone up to switch the next words or phrases.<br>- Time Limited: Challenge your wit and quick thinking as you race against the clock to guess the word on the screen. <br><br>\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>Features of party charades:</b><br>- Guess the word, take the challenge: Helps you exercise your brain, think and come up with accurate solutions. Increased creativity and challenge makes players excited.<br>- Connect, communicate, celebrate: There is nothing better than being able to connect with family, friends, and relatives through a game. Enjoy your wonderful vacation with your wonderful people.<br>- Unlimited topics: You can freely choose the topics you like, we have enough topics for every holiday, event, party. Topics will be updated regularly.<br>- Simple graphics and sound, easy to use.<br><br>\ufe0f\ud83c\udf89<b>Party Charades: Guessing Game</b> is more than just a game - it&#39;s an experience that brings people together, sparks laughter, and creates lasting memories. With its innovative combination of party charades, and party dynamics, this family and group games is a must-have for anyone who loves a good time. Get ready to elevate your gatherings and let the charades party begin!",
